 [:answer.type/math "(1,-2)"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14013817/state.json" "file_sha256" "0a685444faccd327a9a553c528ef51d6a23e914a34faf9f99d0a9afa2864db2d" "basis" 1173 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14013817/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-16380" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "(2,-1)"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14013817/state.json" "file_sha256" "0a685444faccd327a9a553c528ef51d6a23e914a34faf9f99d0a9afa2864db2d" "basis" 1173 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14013817/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-16380" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "(1,-2)"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14013817/state.json" "file_sha256" "0a685444faccd327a9a553c528ef51d6a23e914a34faf9f99d0a9afa2864db2d" "basis" 1173 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14013817/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-116107" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "What is the center of the hyperbola \n${x}^{2}-8{y}^{2}+6x+48y=71?$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14013817/state.json" "file_sha256" "0a685444faccd327a9a553c528ef51d6a23e914a34faf9f99d0a9afa2864db2d" "basis" 1173 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14013817/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-116107" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "The equation of a horizontal hyperbola centered at $(h,k)$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\frac{(x-h)^{2}}{{a}^{2}}-\\frac{(y-k)^{2}}{{b}^{2}}=1.\n$$\n\nTo rewrite the equation of the hyperbola in the above form, we need to group $x$ and $y$ terms and complete the squares, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}^{2}-8{y}^{2}+6x+48y & =71 \\\\ {x}^{2}+6x-8{y}^{2}+48y & =71 \\\\ [{x}^{2}+6x]-8[{y}^{2}-6y] & =71 \\\\ [(x+3)^{2}-9]-8[(y-3)^{2}-9] & =71 \\\\ (x+3)^{2}-9-8(y-3)^{2}+72 & =71 \\\\ (x+3)^{2}-8(y-3)^{2} & =8 \\\\ \\frac{(x+3)^{2}}{8}-(y-3)^{2} & =1 \\\\ \\frac{(x-(-3))^{2}}{(\\sqrt{8})^{2}}-\\frac{(y-3)^{2}}{{1}^{2}} & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the center is $(-3,3).$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14013817/state.json" "file_sha256" "0a685444faccd327a9a553c528ef51d6a23e914a34faf9f99d0a9afa2864db2d" "basis" 1173 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14013817/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-116107" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14013817/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "08283654b18d4f3db96e73000f824a9f15e18318a753ff27764d0667804ac18d" "basis" 1173 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14013817/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-116107" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14013817/state.json" "file_sha256" "0a685444faccd327a9a553c528ef51d6a23e914a34faf9f99d0a9afa2864db2d" "basis" 1173 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14013817/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-116107" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "(-3,3)"] "category" "ma_capture" "fi